      {
        "title": "Secondary data analysis project",
        "description": "This project aims to analyze the impact of urbanization on local biodiversity by collecting and assessing environmental data from multiple urban centers. Using remote sensing, field observations, and statistical modeling, the study will identify key factors influencing species diversity and habitat loss. The findings will support sustainable urban planning initiatives and inform conservation strategies."
